{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年59歲的王祖賢是90年代女神，她當年憑着電影《倩女幽魂》飾演女鬼聶小倩一角而傾倒眾生，絕美的樣貌和造型令人留下深刻印象，奠定女神地位，至今依然令人回味。王祖賢已息影多年，並移居加拿大潛心修佛過着低調生活，但她仍備受喜愛，一眾網民至今依然關注她，她亦偶爾會於社交網分享生活近況。月前王祖賢更進駐了多個內地社交平台與粉絲和網民互動。</p><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250310/975723714098237440239460.jpeg/snSJx02w91-U-r_N-LnCc3YUyNBCDGM-FhSfVBYUn1Q\"/><figcaption>王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647624661143552917306.png/B6ML_dyH70pVtTFGffQ3KcWWc3SzE1q2DHRYYgx0WGI\"/><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647629338054656905831.png/VyNDjNHAIP_GOu-5ncpoX3oHiInbvOf6_X1IJP19SCQ\"/><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><p>享受簡樸生活自給自足</p><p>日前王祖賢就於抖音發布了她最新的vlog，於文案中寫道：「這麼大的香瓜和黃瓜我請客！哈哈😄🌹🙏」。影片一開頭寫了「王祖賢的農物治癒手記」，片中可見王祖賢身穿素色鬆身長款背心配闊腳長褲，打扮十分之悠閒樸實，予人一種洗盡鉛華，反樸歸真的感覺。她分享了平日在空閒時間到農場體驗種菜的慢生活，親手種植各種蔬菜，由下種子開始，親力親為絕不假手於人。她一邊種植一邊講解，看來已相當有經驗。而到了收成的日子她又到農場收成所種植的蔬菜，享受自給自足的農耕樂趣。王祖賢表示喜歡這種平凡的日子，不用追趕時間，感到舒心又快樂。</p><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢的vlog。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247277932548096280735.jpeg/9yh9mM_ULwfP5ASDkioUff8yxNCpncnYrf7w2K3-8Ng\"/><figcaption>王祖賢的vlog。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢種菜。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247288020373504791482.jpeg/btJ7PkbHK1Ci8OjekE23kSTcOCCUSiUgpeXIbaXlyG0\"/><figcaption>王祖賢種菜。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢到農場。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247286048919552695174.jpeg/KUk0dc32bElAertd8Kt5oyUb19Kns2VkE_mAGhP5gBo\"/><figcaption>王祖賢到農場。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢做農夫。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247283775475712769048.jpeg/q4UHntDV9bmVOKStTW4E9mZ5YXBHhNfTOdnyqTnZ8qk\"/><figcaption>王祖賢做農夫。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢親自種菜。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247281489448960438057.jpeg/-XpBXTUY7Bz3M7jYnY16PT4AYQUah6r0l6b9iJem_Yg\"/><figcaption>王祖賢親自種菜。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢享受悠閒生活。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247279169867776973684.jpeg/UMv1i_1hnSOsowLYnrqVdqKJWbH4kxebQLKj00Cyo9M\"/><figcaption>王祖賢享受悠閒生活。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢好靚。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247288284614656947205.jpeg/tovQUzSYaAmsL77npVGa-RJqf6-X_F5EEOpzpxDqc6c\"/><figcaption>王祖賢好靚。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢洗盡鉛華。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247286090862592637284.jpeg/M32hJRoQIEhxMZ3O23dUb4nK1mpDXdqEqvu3Mar7tzE\"/><figcaption>王祖賢洗盡鉛華。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢收成蔬菜。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247283892916224950632.jpeg/O5AwLWBGYzlYR-3cXpR3rnLqaT9dPu9g4qm2z-Kpts8\"/><figcaption>王祖賢收成蔬菜。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢享受生活。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247281464283136319208.jpeg/jCwBg6o1m9XqVAWW8OWvELAcM-gcdoM0cqIBAXKiAQE\"/><figcaption>王祖賢享受生活。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王祖賢親力親為。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139247279169867776735492.jpeg/SN4NdGhtyBJZIPBi9-r8O7kK5dYMPqy7FOtZnRTrWZ0\"/><figcaption>王祖賢親力親為。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T06:39:09.657566+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":652,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}